Description: MOObject defines the multiOmicDataSet object class which is used in
    MOSuite for differential RNA-seq and multi-omics analyses.
    Separating the MOObject class definition from MOSuite allows for lightweight
    installations in downstream workflows.
    See the website for more information: <https://ccbr.github.io/MOObject/>.
    See the MOSuite website for the most comprehensive documentation:
    <https://ccbr.github.io/MOSuite/>.
